Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 06:09:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/16] cli: record benchmark timings for TypeScript workflows

The quickjs host merges the JS phases into the bench-timings file
in-process, so `codemod workflow run -w workflow.ts` writes one timings
file labelled ts-quickjs without the Node launcher.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
